Webcam In Use: watch only /dev/video* and report any open device.

Since upstream commit 5d9f92f ("watch /dev rather than /sys") the monitor
globs /dev/* and treats every character device (null, tty, rfkill,
hidraw, ...) as a video device, and the sensor shows whichever device's
event came last. The result is a sensor that sits on at startup and flaps
on unrelated device opens. Restrict the glob to video* and compute the
state over all watched devices.

